{"seq":14,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:43:26.836Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"265e0ae2694ce1f7c0bf3f2c1e3b9200afff675490323d6b98b1bd03b134e063","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth Calloway, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04, from Nadia Fennimore. The 5/3 Sunday prep says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms it as effective that day.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The digests call it \"Gideon's fleet account\" throughout. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which doesn't match the earlier references, so confirm that if you plan to show a date for it.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest has the 55-seat account as \"Gideon's medical account\". Nadia owned it in the 3/2025 digest, but the digests don't say when it moved.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't give you an owner. The digests only call it the pod's shared retail/outdoor account, and the only name attached is Nadia volunteering to host the 10/2 gate-clerk training. That isn't ownership, so check the CRM before it goes on the slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:43:31.231Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"95bb4954947a4eee8f981de416cc0ab38db973f4f1ebc660309be7de75c8748f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I posted the answer in #strategic-pod. It comes from Moss's Strategic digests only. I didn't check the CRM or account profiles.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04, from Nadia Fennimore. The 5/3 prep note says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the reassignment was effective that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests call it \"Gideon's fleet account\". The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which conflicts with earlier digests that already called it his. Confirm that before putting a date on the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest calls the 55-seat account \"Gideon's medical account\". The 3/2025 digest has Nadia on it, and the digests don't say when it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only call it the pod's shared retail/outdoor account. Nadia volunteered to host a training session, but that isn't ownership. Check the CRM before it goes on the slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
